# Semgrep/OpenGrep ignore patterns
# Documentation files - expected to mention AI providers, technologies
README.md
*.md
docs/

# Environment example files - expected to contain configuration examples
.env.example
*.example

# Test fixtures and mocks
**/test/**
**/tests/**
**/__tests__/**
**/fixtures/**

# Generated/compiled files
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/node_modules/**
**/__pycache__/**
*.pyc

# IDE and editor config
.vscode/
.idea/

# AI service files - expected to contain AI provider references
backend/app/services/ai_review.py
backend/app/core/config.py
